<title>USA: SMART Modular  files for share offering.</title>
<headline>SMART Modular  files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>SMART Modular Technologies Inc said Monday it has filed a registration statement for a proposed public offering of 2,070,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Of the shares being offered, 1.1 million shares will be offered by the company and 970,000 shares will be offered by selling shareholders.</p>
<p>The offering will be managed by Morgan Stanley Dean Witter, Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, Cowen &amp; Co and Montgomery Securities. The company has granted the underwriters an over-allotment option of 310,500 shares.</p>
</text>
